view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-29T20:03:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T23:32:43Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"chandrashakherkamasani","id":311595135,"node_id":"U_kgDOEpKQfw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/311595135?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandrashakherkamasani","html_url":"https://github.com/chandrashakherkamasani","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandrashakherkamasani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandrashakherkamasani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandrashakherkamasani/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandrashakherkamasani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandrashakherkamasani/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandrashakherkamasani/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandrashakherkamasani/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandrashakherkamasani/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandrashakherkamasani/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Description\n\nWhen running the `/goal` slash command with large models (such as Claude Opus 5.5), Antigravity CLI enters an unbroken autonomous execution loop that never compacts conversation history and enforces no token or turn limits. As tool outputs accumulate linearly, the input context resubmitted on each turn grows quadratically, leading to massive and uncontrollable token consumption.\n\n### Concrete Incident & Forensic Data\n\n- **CLI Session ID:** `c9d942b5-1f0f-43ec-b4bc-9bdd5a480642`\n- **Model:** Claude Opus 5.5 (Medium)\n- **Workload:** Multi-project codebase & database inspection\n- **Execution:** Unbroken `/goal` loop across 217 model turns\n- **Context Growth Progression:**\n  - Turn 0: 30,653 tokens (baseline with rules & active MCP server schemas)\n  - Turn 40: 72,794 tokens\n  - Turn 80: 110,162 tokens\n  - Turn 120: 175,582 tokens\n  - Turn 160: 247,320 tokens\n  - Turn 200: 323,288 tokens\n  - Turn 216: **360,023 tokens per single tool invocation**\n- **Total Billed:** **36,954,706 tokens** (36,894,984 Input / 59,721 Output) in under an hour, consuming **40% of the weekly account quota**.\n\n### Core Flaws\n\n1. **No Circuit Breaker:** There is no default or configurable cap on consecutive autonomous turns (`--max-turns`) or token consumption (`--max-budget-tokens`) for `/goal`.\n2. **Missing Autonomous Compaction:** `/compact` exists as a manual slash command, but the autonomous agent runner in `/goal` mode never triggers compaction mid-flight, even when context surpasses 150k–300k tokens.\n3. **Zero Real-Time UI Visibility:** The TUI only displays spinner/tool status; the user is completely blind to the explosive token burn rate until manually checking `/usage`.\n\n### Requested Remediation\n\n1. **Default & Configurable Circuit Breakers:** Add `--max-turns` (e.g., default 50 turns with prompt to continue) and a token spend budget for `/goal`.\n2. **Automated Mid-Flight Compaction:** Automatically invoke context compaction / summary checkpointing when session context exceeds a defined threshold (e.g., 100k tokens) during autonomous loops.\n3. **Live Token Spend Counter:** Display live cumulative session token consumption in the TUI status bar.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google-antigravity/antigravity-cli/issues/1367/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google-antigravity/antigravity-cli/issues/1367/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}